  * [INT04] Fix false sharing between adaptive hash search counter shards
  * [INT04] Fix SIGILL in my_rnd_double() on CPUs without SSE4.2/ARMv8-CRC
  * PS-10990 [8.0]: Crash on Item_cache::walk on specific join executed withing stored procedure
  * Bug#36128964: Item_cache::walk at sql/item.cc
  * [INT04] Revert "[INT03] guard against use-after-free in Item_cache::walk()"
